13:["$","p","6",{"className":"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600 first:mt-0","children":"True to its pan-African vocation, ABS grounds its action in a broader perspective than individual success alone. We want to contribute to the emergence of professionals capable of meeting the needs of Mali, of supporting Africa's transformations and of carrying its ambitions in a constantly changing international environment."}]
14:["$","p","7",{"className":"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600 first:mt-0","children":"This ambition imposes a permanent requirement on us: to bring training closer to professional realities, to encourage initiative, to cultivate open-mindedness and to make every pathway an opportunity to develop one's potential. For educating is not merely transmitting knowledge: it is giving everyone the means to become an agent of their own future and a contributor to the progress of their society."}]
15:["$","p","8",{"className":"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600 first:mt-0","children":"To future students, to professionals seeking to strengthen their skills and to the parents who place their trust in us, I extend a sincere invitation: discover our fields of study, meet our teams and join the ABS community."}]
16:["$","p","9",{"className":"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600 first:mt-0","children":"Do not choose just a diploma. Choose a training that broadens your vision, strengthens your professional value, sharpens your judgement and prepares you to seize the opportunities of tomorrow. Choose a pathway that gives you the means to accomplish your ambitions while contributing to those of Africa."}]
17:["$","p","10",{"className":"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600 first:mt-0","children":"I invite you to discover our educational project and to begin your enrolment process. We will be delighted to support you in building your future."}]
18:["$","p","11",{"className":"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600 first:mt-0","children":"At ABS, we do not regard education as a mere stage in a journey: we regard it as a force capable of revealing talents, of transforming trajectories and of helping to build tomorrow's Africa."}]
19:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 leading-8 text-slate-600","children":"Yours sincerely,"}]
